    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366600/extras/78e4409456bd6aecfe2238ebc27aa49e.avif?t=1734437293\" width=414 height=282 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366600/extras/8e5312de978fec7578a29ec9d104f3b7.avif?t=1734437293\" width=258 height=516 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366600/extras/27dc3d22f040c3670c4eb601bf8cbbe1.avif?t=1734437293\" width=262 height=540 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366600/extras/52156a67a55f43e64bd8aad776e5cb3e.avif?t=1734437293\" width=264 height=538 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366600/extras/a46d9e6c56f2383b99514ab2b8ef45d5.avif?t=1734437293\" width=258 height=538 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366600/extras/a5ea8114ea440daddfca4389fdab05a2.avif?t=1734437293\" width=262 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the vast depths of space, lies a man with a dark past. Setting himself apart from that old life, and seeking justice against wrongdoing instead of being the cause of it, Captain Righteous uses the Freedom Fighter, his trusty space fighter to search for and combat the evil Captain Buster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of Captain Righteous in this retro-style arcade space shooter! Do YOU have what it takes to complete all 40 levels? Find out in Chaotic Entertainment, LLC.'s first worldwide release! This game is fun for all ages and will make for a good addition to your digital library!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366600/extras/78e4409456bd6aecfe2238ebc27aa49e.avif?t=1734437293\" width=414 height=282 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366600/extras/8e5312de978fec7578a29ec9d104f3b7.avif?t=1734437293\" width=258 height=516 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366600/extras/27dc3d22f040c3670c4eb601bf8cbbe1.avif?t=1734437293\" width=262 height=540 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366600/extras/52156a67a55f43e64bd8aad776e5cb3e.avif?t=1734437293\" width=264 height=538 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366600/extras/a46d9e6c56f2383b99514ab2b8ef45d5.avif?t=1734437293\" width=258 height=538 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366600/extras/a5ea8114ea440daddfca4389fdab05a2.avif?t=1734437293\" width=262 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the vast depths of space, lies a man with a dark past. Setting himself apart from that old life, and seeking justice against wrongdoing instead of being the cause of it, Captain Righteous uses the Freedom Fighter, his trusty space fighter to search for and combat the evil Captain Buster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of Captain Righteous in this retro-style arcade space shooter! Do YOU have what it takes to complete all 40 levels? Find out in Chaotic Entertainment, LLC.'s first worldwide release! This game is fun for all ages and will make for a good addition to your digital library!</p>",
